-- Machine-local overrides. Copy to `local.lua` (gitignored) and edit.
--
-- Loaded after lazy.nvim finishes, so plugins are available here. Use this for
-- anything tied to one machine or one employer: debug targets with absolute
-- paths, private LSP settings, work-only keymaps.

